**A Complete Road & Flight Guide to Seeing All 30 NBA Arenas in Spring 2027**

- **Total Stops:** 30 Arenas / 30 NBA Franchises
- **Dates Covered:** March 1, 2027 – April 4, 2027 (35 Days)
- **Marquee Star-Player Showcases:** 11 Games featuring **LeBron James** (LAL), **Stephen Curry** (GSW), and **Victor Wembanyama** (SAS)
- **Routing Strategy:** Regional Clusters connected by efficient domestic flights, utilizing scenic road trip drives where cities are under 4–5 hours apart (e.g., Texas Triangle, Florida Turnpike, Midwest corridor, Northeast Amtrak/I-95 corridor).

---

## Complete 30-Stop Master Itinerary Table

| Stop | Date | Arena & City | Matchup | Star Featured | Travel Leg & Cheapest Mode | Travel Cost | Hotel & Est. Nightly Price | Food Recommendation | Running Total |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
`;

let runningTotal = 0;

for (let i = 0; i < 30; i++) {
